<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sarrācum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">serrā-</span></b> ), i, n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A kind of wagon</i> or <i>cart</i>
			(acc. to <i><span class="en">Quint. 8, 3, 21</span></i>, belonging to vulgar
			lang.), Sisenn. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 195, 29</span></i>; Cic.
			Pis. Fragm. ap. Quint. l. l.; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 10, 1
					<i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 3,
			255</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Capitol. M. Aurel. 13</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Amm. 31, 2,
			18</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>the Wain</i>, a
			constellation: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frigida Bootae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv. 5,
					23</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
